# Pillow 12.3.0 in the acados code-generation venv of the Humble devel image
# (/opt/acados/.venv). Every fix is in Pillow 13, which needs Python 3.11, and
# Humble has 3.10; acados_template imports matplotlib, so Pillow cannot go. The
# venv only turns our own solver models into C code at build time and never
# reads an image, and no runtime image ships it. Reviewed again by the expiry.
